  "2026-08-20T20:05:17.854Z","harness:codex","Scope correction 2026-08-20: full source inspection shows validate already detects dependency-row hierarchy cycles, but the remaining acceptance requires pre-write rejection inside create/update mutation transactions, graph analyze and health parity, terminal legacy classification, and randomized merge conformance. No source file for this item was changed in this branch. Returning it open and releasing ownership rather than shipping or claiming another partial hierarchy tranche."
  "2026-08-21T03:52:54.595Z","harness:codex","Implementation start 2026-08-21: selected after live all-status review of 2,526 items (2,202 closed, 310 open, 14 canceled), zero pre-existing in-progress items, full metadata/comments/history/relationship reads, and current GitHub/security/dependency/release inventory. This branch will finish mutation fail-fast, graph/health/validate parity, terminal legacy classification, every accepted hierarchy spelling, and merge-composition negative controls. Only this issue and the direction/cardinality companion pm-vk7zek are claimed."
  "2026-08-21T05:34:28.796Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence 2026-08-21: shipped one registry-driven hierarchy analyzer across SDK graph assembly, graph analyze/audit/remediation, validate, health, parent filters, tree and child rollups, create/update mutation transactions, and merge composition. All accepted hierarchy spellings share direction/cardinality semantics; new active defects fail before persistence with stable error codes, while terminal-only legacy debt remains visible and advisory. Audit summary no longer repeats the finding census, reducing the update help surface by 8 tokens and keeping repository token gates green."
